# Configuration is split (see app/config.py): PUBLIC values are
# browser-safe and may be rendered into pages; SERVER values are
# secrets that must never reach a client. The prefix is the tool
# name upper-cased with dashes as underscores.
# Copy to .env and fill in local values. Never commit a real .env.

# <PREFIX>_PUBLIC_APP_NAME={{ProjectName}}
# <PREFIX>_SERVER_API_KEY=
